    "title": "Corrupted Island Rap Battle V2",
    "description": "Boyfriend and pibbiefied Girlfriend managed to enter the corrupted island last Friday night, only for them to get attacked by the funky Darkness in corruption. Several glitch characters have been corrupted including BF and GF in this funky universe, but Piby is still her normal self. Will BF/GF save everyone or will BF finally lose the battle? Let's find out.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Feel digital rhythm to tap the arrows perfectly match.\r\n- Try your best to get the highest score point.\r\n- Challenge yourself with finger-breaking difficulties.\r\n- Beat all enemies (Impostor V5, suicide mouse, funny circus)! Rock the beat! Dance with cg5!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Super easy gameplay, NO need wifi\r\n- Huge chance to beat glitch enemies (Doors, Blue V1, El Chavo)\r\n- Bunch of fantastic backgrounds and amazing sound effects\r\n- Always save your journey while you exit the game\r\n- Not require starting a new mode of play\r\n- Be updated monthly!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFollow our vibrant game community for newest updates!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Boyfriend and pibbiefied Girlfriend managed to enter the corrupted island last Friday night, only for them to get attacked by the funky Darkness in corruption. Several glitch characters have been corrupted including BF and GF in this funky universe, but Piby is still her normal self. Will BF/GF save everyone or will BF finally lose the battle? Let&#39;s find out.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY?<br>- Feel digital rhythm to tap the arrows perfectly match.<br>- Try your best to get the highest score point.<br>- Challenge yourself with finger-breaking difficulties.<br>- Beat all enemies (Impostor V5, suicide mouse, funny circus)! Rock the beat! Dance with cg5!<br><br>GAME FEATURE<br>- Super easy gameplay, NO need wifi<br>- Huge chance to beat glitch enemies (Doors, Blue V1, El Chavo)<br>- Bunch of fantastic backgrounds and amazing sound effects<br>- Always save your journey while you exit the game<br>- Not require starting a new mode of play<br>- Be updated monthly!<br><br>Have fun!<br>Follow our vibrant game community for newest updates!",
